  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegalese delegation visit VIV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The invitation of three Senegalese representatives of the poultry sector, following Dutch-Senegalese online working group sessions to explore collaboration, will increase knowledge among the Senegalese poultry business community about the Dutch poultry sector and investment opportunities. It allows Dutch companies participating in the VIV to show innovations at the VIV Europe Poultry Exhibition and Conference in Utrecht (31 May - 2 June 2022). The visit to the VIV further contributes to&#x2022;	Increased knowledge for RVO and the Agricultural counsellor on Dutch innovations and how the Dutch government can facilitate public-private partnerships in the poultry sector in Senegal; &#x2022;	Dutch investments in the Senegalese poultry value chain;&#x2022;	Support developing the Senegalese poultry sector; &#x2022;	Insights on how the Dutch poultry sector can contribute, assessing concrete cooperation opportunities;&#x2022;	Laying the foundation for a Dutch-Senegalese poultry business partnership;&#x2022;	Evaluating the possibility of implementing the proposed projects in the previous working group sessions.</narrative>
  </description>
